      "factual_description": "Jazz at Lincoln Center presents the fourth annual Unity Jazz Festival on January 15-16, 2027, beginning at 6:00 PM each evening throughout Frederick P. Rose Hall. The currently announced lineup includes Arturo O'Farrill and the Afro Latin Jazz Orchestra, pianist/composer Myra Melford, and percussionist Weedie Braimah with The Hands of Time; JALC states that additional acts are still to be announced. The festival is designed as an intergenerational and multicultural survey of 21st-century jazz and music associated with jazz, with general-admission festival access and a late-night Dizzy's Club option for ticket holders.",
